EcruteakCity_Interior2_Text_Woman3::
	.string "Do you know about APRICORNS?\p"
	.string "Crack one open, hollow it out and\n"
	.string "fit it with a special device.\p"
	.string "Then you can catch POKéMON with it.\p"
	.string "Before POKéBALLS were invented,\n"
	.string "everyone used APRICORNS.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior2_Text_MgDeliveryman::
	.string "Where did you say you’re from?\p"
	.string "NEW BARK TOWN?\p"
	.string "PROF.ELM lives over there, right?\p"
	.string "You’ve come a long way to get here.$"
